WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.850
Welcome home, Master.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.610
Adorable heart pose, go!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.700
<b><i>Thank you for coming</i></b>

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.500
Add your love to it!

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.610
Of course!

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.610
Love, love! Love, love!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.630
Be delicious for my master!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.260
<b><i>Conserve Water</i></b>

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.640
I'm so tired. In body and soul both...

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:50.610
But I have to make money. 
I have to keep earning.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.450
I have to support him.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.300
I love you, Aizo.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:06.460
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:10.960
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.300
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.540
<b>Heroines Run the Show</b>

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:30.940
<i>I need more love, want to see you again soon</i>

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:35.030
<i>Lock eyes with you and tell you</i>

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>My sincerest "Thank you for everything"</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.200
<i>Will you love me—
not as a fan, but for real?</i>

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.250
<i>"Pick me"</i>

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.960
<i>"No, pick me"</i>

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.840
<i>Choose which kiss you want</i>

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.980
<i>And let your Romeo bind you</i>

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:02.470
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.020
<i>I'm charmed watching you sing with me</i>

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.340
<i>I'm even charmed by your tears</i>

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.740
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:18.360
<i>Thank you for coming to meet me</i>

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.660
<i>Thank you for calling my name</i>

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.200
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.400
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:35.670
Good mornin'!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.090
Morning!

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.050
Good morning.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.050
Early practice?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.800
Yup! I ran too hard.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:52.790
There's the bell!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.090
R-Right.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:08.370
And the melon bread at the bakery 
by the station was super tasty!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.460
Yes! Nice!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.880
Wow, they started earlier than usual.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.380
I wonder if they even ate lunch.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.010
What's up?

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:35.390
I-I'll buy a drink and catch up with you.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.720
Didn't Chizuru just buy tea?

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.660
Did she?

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.790
Go, go!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:46.910
Ah, so close!

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.910
One more time!

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:54.340
<i>O-Oh, God! The passionate sweat 
of youth... I can't even right now!</i>

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.810
My boyfriend says he's been to the
 bakery you were talking about.

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.050
Hey, don't look at her so much.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:15.170
It's not Suzumi I'm looking at.
 It's the one with the glasses.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:16.940
Glasses?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.650
Something up with her?

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.890
Chizuru?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.660
It's nothing.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.960
Hiyori-chan, your speed went down.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.020
What?!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:51.720
I've been eatin' a lot lately. 
Maybe I gained weight.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.810
I'll go do ten dash drills.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.080
They've gotten good at talk segments.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.080
Really? Thank you!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.830
Looking good!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.580
Good stuff!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.610
Time for a costume change.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.080
Everyone, check your data!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.090
Okay here!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:32.090
Hello, ma'am!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.340
You're looking quite professional 
these days. And you're in perfect sync.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:36.540
Thank you, ma'am.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.730
The chief editor peeked in a little while ago

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.770
and suggested making the next 
issue a LIP×LIP edition!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.490
That's great.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:49.640
Want to put LIP×LIP on the cover, the color 
pages, and both sides of the foldout?

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.910
Absolutely!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.890
If we're in the color pages, 
there'll be a long interview, too.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:55.870
Definitely.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.500
Uchida-san, what strings did you pull?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.130
Don't be silly. They just acknowledge 
how big you are, that's all.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.560
Yeah, LIP×LIP is on fire lately.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.030
Say, I don't see that girl today.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.030
You know, the one who's 
always running around.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.150
Oh, I'm afraid Hiyoko quit.

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:19.140
Aw, man. She was so energetic, 
it was fun to watch her.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.440
It's better this way. Quieter.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.270
Too sweet!

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.270
Too bitter!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.650
Oh, sorry!

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.780
That's my fault.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.660
I'm sorry about that.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:40.650
I let Hiyoko handle you for long 
enough that I misremembered.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.920
Is she doing well?

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.810
Yeah, seems like it.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.620
She's not getting harassed anymore, right?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.300
Things seem fine.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.320
Well, that's good...

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:59.690
But you know, I feel like I 
could've done more for her.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:05.420
I keep thinking about how I 
wish she'd stayed on with us.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.910
I want to support LIP×LIP more 
than I want to keep runnin' my race.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:16.540
Right now reassuring the fans 
is more important than my goals.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.920
What we have to do right 
now is work on LIP×LIP.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.420
We'll go all-out. That's all.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.830
This is great! Chizu-chan, you try some!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.830
It's the brand-new 
"miso and fresh cream" bun!

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.680
That combination is just wrong.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.140
Darned if it ain't tasty, though!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:40.640
Here.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.400
Huh? That's surprisingly good.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.440
Right?

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.730
Seriously?

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.470
Can I try, too?

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:54.660
Of course!

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.700
Yum! A miracle is happening 
in my mouth right now!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.100
I'll buy some for you two next time.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.030
Nah, it's not <i>that</i> good.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.580
What?!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.830
The storm has really passed, huh?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.270
"Storm"?

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:18.100
I mean the harassment.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.600
Oh... Yeah.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.350
You had it rough.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.860
I'm okay.

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.730
I mean...

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:35.090
the fans were sad, and that's worse.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.990
I feel awful about that.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.660
You sound like part of their agency.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.240
Agency? I thought she sounded like a mom.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:51.670
Oh, I just meant I hope 
that never happens again!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:54.190
Oh, yeah?

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.680
Uh-huh!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:59.670
Well, the next time someone 
does something that miserable,

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.230
I'll track down the culprit!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.570
Juri-chan!

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:04.980
You with me, Chizuru?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:10.820
We'll always be on your side, Suzumi-san.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.440
I'm so happy...

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:21.060
Friends are our most precious treasures!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:22.990
Wow, dramatic much?

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.650
It's how I feel!

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.170
I just remembered, the teacher 
asked me to do something.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.780
I'll see you in class.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.980
Pisses me off... Pisses me off... 
Pisses me off... Pisses me off!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.060
Pisses me off... Pisses me off... 
Pisses me off... Pisses me off!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.190
She pisses me off!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.940
"The fans were sad"? How dare she?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.610
The one who made us sad...

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.950
was her!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.810
If it weren't for her...

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:09.000
If <i>she</i> weren't around...!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.430
You have practice today, right, Hiyori?

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:31.050
Yep.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:31.900
How about tomorrow?

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.650
Nope, no practice tomorrow.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.890
Then can we come over to your place?

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:37.360
Huh?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:42.170
Let's have a pajama party! 
We can order pizza and stuff.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:42.900
Pizza!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.780
It'll be a blast.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.380
Right?

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.620
S-Sure... But wouldn't we be imposing?

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.500
No, not at all!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.720
Please come! I'll clean up!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.580
Okay, it's settled!

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.200
Teacher, teacher!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.660
Yes, Suzumi-san?

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.280
I wanna hear about your romance!

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:02.760
Huh?

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.940
S-Sure...

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:13.900
But in that case, you two have 
to spill about your crushes.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.030
Huh? Nah, I don't have any.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.150
You sure?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.780
It's true, I swear!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.050
How about you, Chizu-chan?

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.530
M-Me?

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.440
Yes, I have a crush.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:29.540
Whoa, you do?! I didn't know!

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.110
Who is it?!

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.180
Hey! Someya-kun!

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:54.530
That hurt...

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:57.400
Chizu-chan, are ya okay?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.950
Hey, idol-face! Don't just walk away!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.380
What's wrong?

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:18.900
These are... the same photos 
from the bulletin board.

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:22.840
Ch-Chizu-chan?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.100
Seriously?

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.060
So you did that, Chizuru?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.100
That's right.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.730
You did?

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.230
Why?!

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.730
Why?

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.610
Because I hate you, that's why!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.950
H-Hate?

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:58.520
Why? I... what?

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.960
Why?!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:17.970
<i>I started runnin' because I couldn't sleep,
 and now look where I am.</i>

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:21.110
<i>Well, should I come over on my own?</i>

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.240
I'm kinda hungry.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.300
Hiyori-chan?

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.090
Mona-chan!

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.730
Fancy meeting you here! 
I'm so glad to see you.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:54.590
I've been coming here for crêpes 
a lot since that day, actually.

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:56.020
Oh, cool!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:58.900
Hiyori-chan...

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.160
Hmm?

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:03.100
Did something happen?

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:07.530
I'm happy to listen.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.450
Mona-chan...

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.040
I'm so sorry that happened.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:22.700
I was so shocked. I had no 
idea she hated me that much.

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:25.420
I thought she was my friend.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:31.660
I... don't know what to do now.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.940
You know, I hated someone once.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.930
I hated my big sister.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:52.820
But hiding behind the hatred were 
feelings like respect and envy.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:59.350
Those were my <i>real</i> feelings, 
but I didn't want to acknowledge them.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:06.420
Hiding your real feelings gets really 
painful after a while, though.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:11.990
Maybe your friend is hurting, too,

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.970
because she can't admit how 
she really feels deep down.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:20.070
How she feels deep down...

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:24.940
Yeah. So the answer to your 
"What do I do?" question is,

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.490
"Try asking her how she feels"!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.730
You're right...

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.910
That's right! That's the only way!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.530
Thanks, Mona-chan!

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.750
I'm gonna ask her!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.230
Mm-hmm!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.640
Mornin'!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.290
Morning!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.360
Mornin', Chizu-chan! Listen, I—

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:32.230
Chizu-chan! Chizu-chan!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.760
We couldn't find Chizuru anywhere, huh?

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:47.110
Wait, how much are you going to eat?!

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:53.140
I need to fuel up! I'm gonna 
catch Chizu-chan after school!

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:55.310
I'm gonna talk to her!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.870
I like it. I'm in!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.450
Well, I'll see you all tomorrow.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.190
Chizu-chan!

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.510
You're not escapin'!

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.500
And she's off.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.400
Chizu-chan!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.400
Chizu-chan!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.400
Chizu-chan!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.900
Chizu-chan!

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:55.750
Seriously, is she for real?

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.380
Found you!

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.390
Nice tackle!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.900
I got Chizu-chan!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.130
Hey, let me go!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.270
No!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.900
I said let go!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.250
No!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.030
Don't you get it?! You're annoying!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.290
Knock it off! Just stop following me!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:26.910
Chizu-chan, if ya have somethin' to 
say to me, I want ya to say <i>all</i> of it!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:30.780
Excuse me? I already told you I hate you.

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:36.880
Yeah, I remember! But I want your... 
well, your true feelings deep down...

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.640
Why do ya hate me?!

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:46.640
Duh! Because you're close to LIP×LIP 
even though you're a damn nobody!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:52.020
I just quietly watch them, 
because <i>I</i> know my place.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.860
I even play a character in a maid 
café just so I can give them money!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.990
But <i>you're</i> too forward!

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:02.520
You think you're so great, 
getting special treatment from idols!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:04.780
No, I don't!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.920
Right on! Keep going!

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:13.130
You're seriously stupid!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.340
No, I ain't!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.990
You traipse around town with them! 
What if someone photographed you?!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:23.560
You're the one who did that! 
And ya made it into a big incident!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:28.430
Why? Why'd ya do somethin' 
to hurt them like that?!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:32.120
That was your fault!

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:34.290
I <i>lived</i> for my bias!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.690
But <i>you</i> came along and made that mess!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:43.030
I did nothing wrong. It's all <i>your</i> fault!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:47.380
How about ya cut the bullshit?!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:50.280
Ya didn't have to set up 
some complicated plot!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:50.960
Shut up!

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:55.710
If ya thought it was my fault, 
ya shoulda just told me so!

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.760
You little...

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.670
I told you to shut up!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.090
...coward!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.470
You damn nobody!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.360
Hiyori!

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:21.000
I-Is she dead?

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.360
Of course not!

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.440
I'm taking her to the nurse's office.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.870
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.740
Huh? I...

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:57.900
